      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Once I tried to connect electronic translators with voice recognition and TTS technology to VRChat. The lack of audio output selection in VRChat did not allow me to fully realize this idea.\nIn 2018, I already wrote about the problem of the language barrier in VRChat, but the developers do not work in this direction. Therefore, I am trying to connect external voice translators to reduce this problem. But for this I need the possibility to select the audio output in VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
