      "value": "@{5d0da7de6372357922f8cd74|full_name}: I tried various voice translators. I use “Google Translate” at this moment. It is not ideal for online games, but in terms of functionality and convenience, it is better suited for VRChat in VR-mode than others. By the way, I've already found a way to get around the restriction due to the inability to select the audio output.",
