      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d4c5018ec71ef2fe297e517|full_name} \nThat is already in the game in Settings\nits at the bottom right of the menu and by clicking the Arrows < or > will change it, if you cant be bothered to do this then go like this.\n1.\nOpen Window Settings > Devices > Bluetooth & other devices > Audio : \ndisable audio of devices you don't want to use and enable those you do.\n2. \nOpen Window Settings > System > Sound > output/input : \nset your headphones to the output/input.\n3. \nOpen Window Settings > System > Sound > Manage sound devices :\nDisable and enable devices you want to use and not use\nVRChat uses what ever you have set for your enabled devices",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
