      "value": "@{5a92ac664bf53c4ab7f6bd8a|full_name}: No, this canny post is for output not input. Input is microphone, output is headphone/speakers. VRChat is yet to fix the output not switching at runtime and there are no options to change output from the in game settings. You have to restart the game to change your output settings.",
