      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: \nMy post still apply's as i said clearly in number 2\n\"Open Window Settings > System > Sound > output/input :\nset your headphones to the output/input.\"\nIt still apply's to what they are asking and my other numbers help as well \nVRChat like i said uses what ever you have set for your enable devices so disable devices your not using and enable devices you are using like the headset and it will use your headset for output/input if you have them set to enable and disable the stuff your not using then it will work.",
